<section class="hero text-white">
<div class="container py-5 text-center">
<h1>Find a room, not just an apartment</h1>
    <p class="lead">Roomies connects people who have a free room in a shared house
      with people who are looking for a place to live.</p>
<a href="#search" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Find a room</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="search" class="container py-5">
  <h2>Search</h2>
<p>Tell us what you are looking for and we will show you the rooms that match.</p>
                                                                        <form class="row g-3">
<div class="col-md-4">
<label for="neighborhood" class="form-label">Neighborhood</label>
      <select class="form-select" id="neighborhood" name="neighborhood">
        <option value="">Any neighborhood</option>
<option value="providencia">Providencia</option>
        <option value="nunoa">Ñuñoa</option>
<option value="las-condes">Las Condes</option>
        <option value="santiago-centro">Santiago Centro</option>
</select>
    </div>
<div class="col-md-4">
<label for="max-rent" class="form-label">Maximum rent</label>
      <input type="number" class="form-control" id="max-rent" name="max_rent" placeholder="400000">
    </div>
<div class="col-md-4">
<label for="available-from" class="form-label">Available from</label>
      <input type="date" class="form-control" id="available-from" name="available_from">
    </div>
<div class="col-12">
<button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Search rooms</button>
    </div>
</form>
</section>

<section class="bg-light py-5">
<div class="container">
<h2>Featured rooms</h2>
    <div class="row g-4">

      <div class="col-md-4">
        <article class="card h-100">
          <%= image_tag "room-1.jpg", class: "card-img-top",
                alt: "Bedroom with a black bed frame, a black and white geometric rug and framed prints on the wall" %>
          <div class="card-body">
            <h3 class="card-title h5">Providencia</h3>
<p class="card-text mb-1">$320.000 per month</p>
            <p class="card-text text-muted mb-0">Available from 1 November 2026</p>
</div>
        </article>
</div>

      <div class="col-md-4">
        <article class="card h-100">
          <%= image_tag "room-2.jpg", class: "card-img-top",
                alt: "Bedroom with a dark grey wall, an upholstered double bed and a window looking over the city" %>
          <div class="card-body">
            <h3 class="card-title h5">Ñuñoa</h3>
<p class="card-text mb-1">$270.000 per month</p>
            <p class="card-text text-muted mb-0">Available from 15 November 2026</p>
</div>
        </article>
</div>

      <div class="col-md-4">
        <article class="card h-100">
          <%= image_tag "room-3.jpg", class: "card-img-top",
                alt: "Bedroom with light green walls, hanging plants and framed pictures above the bed" %>
          <div class="card-body">
            <h3 class="card-title h5">Santiago Centro</h3>
<p class="card-text mb-1">$250.000 per month</p>
            <p class="card-text text-muted mb-0">Available from 1 December 2026</p>
</div>
        </article>
</div>

    </div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="container py-5">
<h2>How it works</h2>
  <div class="row g-4">
    <div class="col-md-4">
      <h3 class="h5">1. Publish or search</h3>
<p>If you have a free room, publish it with photographs, the rent and the date it
becomes available. If you are looking for one, search by neighborhood, price and date.</p>
</div>
    <div class="col-md-4">
      <h3 class="h5">2. Apply</h3>
<p>Send the host a short presentation with the date you want to move in and how long
you plan to stay. The host reads every application and answers.</p>
</div>
    <div class="col-md-4">
      <h3 class="h5">3. Visit and move in</h3>
<p>The host invites you to see the house. After the visit you can leave a review, and
  the host chooses the housemate.</p>
                       </div>
  </div>
</section># frozen_string_literal: true

